        "text": "Chief Justice asked whether, in Bostick, the police informed passengers that they had a right to refuse consent."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9d20fdc73c8a8f73c9364cdfbd0df79f268f7976ab997f73818e5702a3202ee7",
