            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, justice Breyer questioned the premise that the Government has an obligation to teach everyone about their rights."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9d20fdc73c8a8f73c9364cdfbd0df79f268f7976ab997f73818e5702a3202ee7",
